{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "18a22851-1c20-464d-b514-4bc983c7ca38", "text": "The people here are very friendly. The area is well maintained and beautiful. You can find literally anything that you need within a 1 mile radius ", "date": "2022-09-09", "who": "Resident", "category": "General", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "3295be03-397d-468a-9c2f-1392de8f1457", "text": "nice neighborhood for families with young kids. great schools. very safe and easy access to manhattan. ", "date": "2024-07-19", "who": "Resident", "category": "General", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "36cec0e8-caa9-46dc-8962-a33e89e26585", "text": "best place to live in queens with access to everything and everywhere. great schools and food stores.", "date": "2022-03-06", "who": "Resident", "category": "General", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "443b7875-699e-4047-9c2a-06bdc502abf4", "text": "Beautiful neighborhood I love to live here good school district good parks good people a lot of restaurants walking distance dog parks sitting area everywhere I love it I would recommended forest hills to any family who would love to raise a family is safe and secured and the people are very friendly and kind perfect place to raise a family \ud83d\ude4f", "date": "2023-08-15", "who": "Resident", "category": "General", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "7992c225-65cb-41ac-8072-28569570792f", "text": "I have lived here for 15 years.  It is a friendly, well maintained neighborhood.   Subways and stores are accessible.  ", "date": "2025-03-31", "who": "Resident", "category": "General", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "8bb37d41-31e2-440b-b43f-078c6f3c8b61", "text": "Beautiful and lovely neighborhood full of neighborly people. \n\nSo great and so nice to live here. \n\n", "date": "2024-02-02", "who": "Resident", "category": "General", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "b4c231fe-5309-494b-91fe-a2321dac9af0", "text": "It's a nice neighborhood with great schools and an easy commute into Manhattan. It is a family friendly area. Very walkable and great concerts at Forest Hills stadium. ", "date": "2024-11-22", "who": "Resident", "category": "General", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "f9d1ec6a-9048-4a46-bc19-687671660ac8", "text": "I live here for two years now and i do love it. A homey feeling around where everything mostly you need are few walk away. Near mass public transit, very good school district, quite diverse but totally quiet and everybody is minding their own business. Banks and restaurants are 2 blocks away and almost eateries are almost endless as the lane of Austin St. goes. Department store across the street, fruit stand and farmers market every sunday morning.", "date": "2022-03-30", "who": "Resident", "category": "General", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "0a790465-19a7-48ef-81ce-c5863239105b", "text": "I personally am I dog owner and I don\u2019t like that some people don\u2019t keep their dog on leash. What if the dogs get lost? ", "date": "2025-10-13", "who": "Resident", "category": "Dog Owners", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "281a4932-9147-404d-8edd-f2464831547c", "text": "Other dog owners don\u2019t pick up their dog\u2019s poop. Dog owners don\u2019t bother to clean up after their dogs. ", "date": "2022-04-27", "who": "Resident", "category": "Dog Owners", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "3ee28837-42c0-47b7-ae56-1521777950a0", "text": "Very dog friendly - I did not own a dog when residing in the area, but during my strolls to stores or to the railroad, I would always see others with their dogs. Neighborhood is beautiful to stroll through.", "date": "2022-05-15", "who": "Prev. Resident", "category": "Dog Owners", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "41333041-ebb5-45c5-b55b-c19da929f05a", "text": "Would spend my life here, die here. Highly recommended . Very diverse. Is a must for an immigrant. Very accessible ", "date": "2023-06-21", "who": "Resident", "category": "Dog Owners", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
