{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "a2b2717a-0722-4cd5-a735-a0880f092ea4", "text": "it is clean and safe place.it is perfect for commute there is a lot of shopping, market, cafee also there is a park around ", "date": "2022-03-10", "who": "Resident", "category": "Community", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "c4b891fb-e63d-476b-a69e-6ec0aea2c0d6", "text": "Halloween decorations; West Side Tennis Club; Children\u2019s Day in Garden every year; Street Fair on Austin Street twice a year", "date": "2022-05-20", "who": "Resident", "category": "Community", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "16d45ecf-6d10-4a44-b7f3-200b140c2291", "text": "I feel safe in my neighborhood since it is peaceful, well lit at night, and people care about keeping it secure", "date": "2026-01-30", "who": "Resident", "category": "Parents", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "229bc660-bd26-468a-89c1-1851275db3bf", "text": "Great area to live and raise families. Close to restaurants and shops. Outside of the city yet a short subway ride takes you into Manhattan. ", "date": "2021-10-18", "who": "Resident", "category": "Parents", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "35f1aa85-c84f-427c-a5ba-f68fafd0d9a2", "text": "Safe, green, lots of playgrounds, a couple of parks, very walkable, restaurants, movie theatre, good schools.", "date": "2021-08-22", "who": "Resident", "category": "Parents", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "6274c6e9-86c7-43bb-90ea-88c8a8b20fba", "text": "Good schools, nice area parks. Local activities decent restaurant s. Nice community and easy to commute to NYC.", "date": "2021-10-05", "who": "Resident", "category": "Parents", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "82e370c4-cc9f-4653-a277-c82a8588a086", "text": "Flushing Meadows Corona Park is just nearby. Lots of playgrounds and schools in the neighborhood. Most importantly it is a safe neighborhood. It also has more trees and green accents than most of other neighborhoods in Queens. The playground located by Grand Central Expressway has a tennis court and athletic field with volleyball court and track among other parts. Also the neighborhood is a walking distance to Forest Park. Great area for kids. ", "date": "2021-07-18", "who": "Resident", "category": "Parents", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "b127a62d-aa5c-47d3-a36c-16171bf7b6f4", "text": "Great neighborhood to live in for families and young people alike.  It is safe and excellent for bringing up children.", "date": "2021-07-28", "who": "Resident", "category": "Parents", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
{"hood_id": "ny:forest-hills", "source": "trulia", "url": "https://www.trulia.com/n/ny/new-york/forest-hills/85231/", "area": "Forest Hills", "kind": "review", "post_id": "b869032c-7bf6-4729-908c-b98478905be1", "text": "Great diversity, many playground, kids activities, very lively, many food options, easy assess to nannies, ", "date": "2023-05-30", "who": "Resident", "category": "Parents", "rating": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:40+00:00", "path": "raw/voices_trulia/109d935e8e82577d.html"}
